data.current_description:
Supports all 14 QR types. URL-based types (url, video, social, app, pdf, coupon, menu)
use `destination_url`. Content types (wifi, vcard, email, sms, phone, text, whatsapp)
pass their fields inside `qr_meta` as a key-value object.

qr_meta fields per type:
  whatsapp: { phone, message }
  wifi:     { ssid, password, encryption (WPA|WEP|nopass) }
  vcard:    { name, phone, email, organization, title, website, address }
  email:    { to, subject, body }
  sms:      { phone, message }
  phone:    { phone }
  text:     { content }

